---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ArticleList from '../../components/ArticleList.astro';
import { tracks as trackLabels } from '../../data/classification';import catalog from '../../data/posts.json';
import {buildProfile} from '../../../scripts/content';
const preview=buildProfile()==='preview';
const posts=(catalog as any[]).filter(p=>p.locales.en&&(preview||p.locales.en.published)).sort((a,b)=>a.order-b.order);
const tracks=[['shared','From model computation to GPU execution'],['inference','Serving requests efficiently with fixed weights'],['training','Pretraining and SFT, from one GPU to multiple nodes'],['rl','Connecting generation, evaluation and learning']];
---
<Base><section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">LLM SYSTEMS ENGINEERING · LEARNING NOTES</p><h1>Understand the systems<br/>that run models.</h1><p class="lede">Models, hardware and workloads.<br/>Build understanding step by step, from shared concepts to inference, training and RL.</p><a class="primary" href="#learn">Explore the learning path ↓</a><div class="axes" aria-label="Three perspectives"><span>Models<small>What computation and state are needed?</small></span><span>Hardware<small>Where and how does execution happen?</small></span><span>Workloads<small>What conditions and goals matter?</small></span></div></section><section id="learn"><h2>Four stages, starting with small examples</h2><div class="tracks">{tracks.map(([id,description], index)=><div class="track"><span class="number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><div><h3>{trackLabels[id].en}</h3><p>{description}</p></div></div>)}</div><p class="note">This site groups pretraining and SFT under training, with RL as a separate learning stage. In common terminology, SFT is also part of post-training.</p></section><section id="articles"><h2>Available articles</h2>{posts.length?<ArticleList posts={posts} locale="en" />:<p class="empty">The first article is in preparation. Published articles will appear here in learning order.</p>}</section></Base>
